  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dark" style="padding-top:clamp(40px,6vw,64px)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card reveal" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Concert%20booking%20enquiry%20for%20Ad%C3%A1n%20Fern%C3%A1ndez">
        <h3>Concert bookings</h3>
        <p>Organ and harpsichord recitals, dedications, conducting engagements and festival appearances.</p>
        <span class="go">Enquire about a date &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card reveal" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Teaching%20or%20masterclass%20enquiry%20for%20Ad%C3%A1n%20Fern%C3%A1ndez">
        <h3>Teaching &amp; masterclasses</h3>
        <p>Organ and piano instruction, university residencies, and workshops for parish musicians.</p>
        <span class="go">Ask about teaching &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card reveal" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Writing%20or%20speaking%20enquiry%20for%20Ad%C3%A1n%20Fern%C3%A1ndez">
        <h3>Writing &amp; speaking</h3>
        <p>Commissions, essays, editorial work, and lectures on liturgy and Latin American sacred music.</p>
        <span class="go">Start a conversation &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="two-col" style="margin-top:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem)">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="rule-head"><span class="lbl">Direct</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
        <p class="lede">Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--brass)">{{ site.email }}</a>, or call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--brass)">{{ site.phone }}</a>.</p>
      </div>
